{"id":"597030","name":"蜂蜜小面包","author":"°ZWH","authorId":"11170916","desc":"","cover":"images/597030/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"高筋粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"120g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄油","amount":"20"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"揉面：250g高筋粉+1个鸡蛋+120g牛奶+2g酵母+2g盐。","img":"images/597030/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉光滑后加20g黄油。","img":"images/597030/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"揉至出手套膜。","img":"images/597030/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/597030/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"g黄油软化在模具底，以便于出脆底。（我是用吹风机吹软的）。","img":"images/597030/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵好的面团揉搓排气。","img":"images/597030/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分成60g每个小剂子，擀成牛舌状，松弛十分钟，再重新擀成牛舌状一次。","img":"images/597030/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"卷起，从中间切开。","img":"images/597030/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"底部蘸一层蜂蜜，再蘸一层细白糖。","img":"images/597030/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"二次饧发至两倍大。","img":"images/597030/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤箱预热，上火180度，下火230度，先烤8分钟。","img":"images/597030/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取出来刷蜂蜜1+橄榄油1+水1的混合液，回烤箱在上面盖上锡纸继续烤15分钟。","img":"images/597030/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取出。","img":"images/597030/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒扣脱模。","img":"images/597030/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撕开。","img":"images/597030/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"层层松软。","img":"images/597030/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/597030/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}